  "rationale": "Endomembrane/nucleus sublibrary (395 genes, 3,945 guides; no non-targeting guides) of the in vivo Toxoplasma CRISPR study. RH tachyzoites passaged in vitro (P4, 3 libraries) and in vivo through WT mice (WT_*, 17 libraries) and Ifngr1-/- mice (KO_*, 10 libraries). In vivo libraries are bottlenecked (top 1% 24-35%), so median_ratio totals and only between-arm comparisons are interpretable. Primary WT vs KO (Table S2A p.value_WTvsKO) finds IFN-gamma-dependent fitness genes; secondary P4 vs WT (p.value_P4vsWT) gives in vivo fitness. ROP18/GRA12/GRA45 are present as shared control-panel genes. No neutral controls, so no calibration/control null.",
